# SEO (Next.js SaaS Marketing)

## Metadata API

- Export `metadata` or `generateMetadata` from `layout.tsx` / `page.tsx`.
- Unique **title** and **description** per indexable page. Template: `%s | ProductName`.
- Set canonical URLs for marketing pages; avoid duplicate content across www/apex.

## Social & structured data

- Provide OG/Twitter images (static or `opengraph-image.tsx`).
- JSON-LD for SoftwareApplication / Organization on the homepage when accurate.
- Do not keyword-stuff. Write for humans first.

## Technical

- `app/sitemap.ts` listing public marketing URLs only (not app dashboard).
- `app/robots.ts` — disallow `/api`, `/app`, `/dashboard`, auth callbacks.
- Performance: optimize LCP images with `next/image`; avoid blocking third-party scripts on landing.

## SaaS-specific

- Pricing, docs, blog, and compare pages earn links — give them real content.
- Gate only the product; keep marketing crawlable.
- After rebrand, 301 old paths.

## Anti-patterns

- `noindex` on the homepage by accident.
- Client-only rendered critical copy (empty HTML for crawlers).
- Fake review schema.
